        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I went today to pick up the color of the year swatch (photo) and got to talking to Mathieu the store Manager. He is very knowledgeable and friendly, great service! Thank you",
        "time": 1706028878,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Janice hogan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111646204921189555453/reviews",
