        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Excellent!!! I was very happy with the service today Joshua was great he matched the small patch of paint i had perfectly & i bought a small can of paint as i needed to do a small repair job in my home & the paint was amazing i just did a small patch test & the color is perfect exactly what i wanted i highly recommend this store really great service!!",
